{% comment %}
  Renders the ZINSETT ShippingETA line (Design Brief §5 `ShippingETA`, §6 PDP
  "ShippingETA line directly under ATC").

  Computes the 8-15 day AutoDS US-delivery window (Brief §1) from "today" and
  renders the §9 copy verbatim:
    "Arrives {{start}}–{{end}} to most US addresses — tracked door-to-door."
  (en dash between the date range, em dash before "tracked", per §9.)

  No settings/inputs required — the window is always "today + 8 days" through
  "today + 15 days", recomputed on every render (no caching), so it never goes
  stale for repeat visitors. Dates render as "Mon D" (e.g. "Jul 16"), or
  "Mon D–Mon D" instead of "Mon D–D" when the window crosses a month boundary.

  Usage:
  {% render 'shipping-eta' %}
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign now_epoch = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
  assign start_epoch = now_epoch | plus: 691200
  assign end_epoch = now_epoch | plus: 1296000
  assign start_month = start_epoch | date: '%b'
  assign end_month = end_epoch | date: '%b'
  assign start_day = start_epoch | date: '%-d'
  assign end_day = end_epoch | date: '%-d'
  if start_month == end_month
    assign eta_start = start_month | append: ' ' | append: start_day
    assign eta_end = end_day
  else
    assign eta_start = start_month | append: ' ' | append: start_day
    assign eta_end = end_month | append: ' ' | append: end_day
  endif
-%}
<p class="zinsett-shipping-eta caption-large">
  <span class="svg-wrapper zinsett-shipping-eta__icon" aria-hidden="true">
    {{- 'icon-truck.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
  </span>
  {{- 'products.product.zinsett_shipping_eta_html' | t: start: eta_start, end: eta_end -}}
</p>
